NORA

This distribution includes code derived from DAGMA by Kevin Bello,
Bryon Aragam, and Pradeep Ravikumar:
https://github.com/kevinsbello/dagma

The upstream continuation controller and Apache-2.0 license are retained
in src/certfix3_rc6/_upstream. The numerical minimizer and reconstruction
steps implement NORA; this distribution is not the unmodified DAGMA solver.

The conditional-column solver, extended-precision numerical routines,
and numerical certification code are retained from the authors' frozen
implementation used in the paper experiments.
